{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"宏福苑火災一周年｜灣仔筲箕灣天主教堂悼念彌撒\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/WF-MASS-261126-22.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】在灣仔、筲箕灣的天主教堂亦有悼念彌撒。</p><p>灣仔天主教聖母聖衣堂的彌撒，教友讀出168位宏福苑亡者姓名，眾人其後鞠躬又頌唱聖詩，並由神父唸出經文，帶領教友為亡者禱告。</p><p>而筲箕灣聖十字架堂同樣有悼念彌撒，有教友於門外的聖母像獻花，教堂坐滿人，由神父帶領下頌唱聖詩。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T14:43:59.585652+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T14:03:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T18:37:36.290188+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T14:37:29.865972+00:00","content_hash":"3afb39ca0318f7924f590975ee54470fff36e4f37332c6398e5a0b796e96391f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T14:43:59.585652+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}